WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:03.149
Unit ten. Eating Well, Not Dieting!

2
00:00:04.116 --> 00:00:07.675
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.725 --> 00:00:11.399
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.449 --> 00:00:15.498
Today we learn about Eating Well, Not Dieting. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.306 --> 00:00:19.673
Nutrition. Say it with me. Nutrition!

6
00:00:23.199 --> 00:00:26.599
Balanced. Say it with me. Balanced!

7
00:00:30.116 --> 00:00:33.617
Energy. Say it with me. Energy!

8
00:00:37.118 --> 00:00:40.985
Skipping meals. Say it with me. Skipping meals!

9
00:00:44.435 --> 00:00:47.302
Growth. Say it with me. Growth!

10
00:00:50.852 --> 00:00:54.719
Body image. Say it with me. Body image!

11
00:00:58.185 --> 00:01:01.018
Hunger. Say it with me. Hunger!

12
00:01:04.532 --> 00:01:07.999
Wellbeing. Say it with me. Wellbeing!

13
00:01:11.496 --> 00:01:21.151
Teens need good nutrition and enough energy for growth. Skipping meals or strict dieting can harm health and wellbeing. Listening to hunger and eating balanced meals supports a healthy body image.

14
00:01:21.201 --> 00:01:23.749
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:25.291 --> 00:01:30.359
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.409 --> 00:01:31.559
Energy!

17
00:01:32.348 --> 00:01:37.368
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.418 --> 00:01:38.568
Hunger!

19
00:01:39.338 --> 00:01:45.158
Did you know? Growing teenagers need regular meals to fuel both their bodies and their brains!

20
00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:46.850
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:55.439
Think and answer. Why can strict dieting be harmful for teenagers?

22
00:01:55.489 --> 00:01:56.639
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.647 --> 00:02:02.392
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.442 --> 00:02:04.982
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

